{"articleNo":"240632","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=240632&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] [SK이노베이션] 취업/진로를 고민 중인 대학생을 위한 이노Up 멘토링 멘티 모집","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2020.08.14","hit":"6712","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height: 1;\"></p><p style=\"line-height: 1;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">구글링으로 찾아본 기업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">직무 정보</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">.. </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">얼마나 정확할까</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">?       </span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">취업 및 진로를 고민중인 전국의 대학생들을 위해</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"> SK</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">이노베이션 계열 임직원들이 나섰다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">.       </span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">취업 시즌 홍보물을 통해 제공되는 일방적</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">단편적 정보에서 벗어나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">      </span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">해당 직무를 수행하는</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"> SK</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">구성원이 전하는 생생한 멘토링이 시작됩니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">.       </span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><br></span></strong></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">1) </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">진행내용</span></strong></strong></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">직무 별 멘토 프로필을 미리 검색하여 평소에 관심있었던 직무 및 멘토를 선정해보고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><o:p></o:p></span></span></strong></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">회사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">해당 직무에 대한 여러분의 관심과 열정을 적극 어필해주세요</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">!       </span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">여러분의 멘토가 여러분의 사연을 읽고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">본인이 멘토링 할 멘티들을 직접 선정하게 됩니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">.       </span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">월말부터 약 한달</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">! </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">랜선으로 진행될 멘토링의 장으로 여러분을 초대합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><br><br><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><strong>2)</strong> </strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>지원일시</strong></span></strong></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong></strong></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">8</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"> 12</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">) ~ 8</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"> 17</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">) 24</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><br><br><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">3 </span></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">선정 결과 발표</span></strong></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">      </span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"> 24</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">예정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">      </span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">SMS </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">및</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"> E-mail </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">안내 예정</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><br></span></p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong></strong></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>4)</strong> </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">진행기간</span></strong></span></strong></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong></strong></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">기수 별</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"> 2</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">회씩</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">회당</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"> 90</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">분</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">      </span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1;\"><spa