span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">) ~ 9</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"> 27</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">)</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"></span><br></span></p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong></strong></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>5)</strong> </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">선발절차</span></strong></span></strong></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong></strong></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">관심있는 직무의 멘토 프로필 검색 → 지원서 제출 → 지원서 검토 및 멘티 선정 → 멘토링 진행</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><br><br><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><strong>6)</strong> </strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>문의처</strong></span></strong></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong></strong></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><a href=\"mailto:skimentoring@sk.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><u><font color=\"#0066cc\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">skimentoring@sk.com</span></font></u></span></a></span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><strong><br></strong></strong></span></span></span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><strong>7)</strong> </strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>지원링크</strong></span></strong></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong></strong></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.skimentoring.co.kr/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><u><font color=\"#0066cc\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">https://www.skimentoring.co.kr/</span></font></u></span></a><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">      </span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><br><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">* </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">본 멘토링은 대학생들의 고충 해소를 